        "runningHead": "Courtroom Verification Checklist",
        "content": "\n        <h2>Courtroom Verification Checklist</h2>\n        <h3>40.1 Pre-Trial Evidence Verification Audit</h3>\n        <p style=\"font-size: 0.81rem; line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n          Before stepping into the witness box, verify that every item on this checklist is completed:\n        </p>\n\n        <table style=\"width: 100%; font-size: 0.71rem; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 6px;\">\n          <tr style=\"background: #064e3b; color: #ffffff;\">\n            <th style=\"padding: 3px 5px; text-align: left; width: 10%;\">Status</th>\n            <th style=\"padding: 3px 5px; text-align: left;\">Forensic Audit Item</th>\n            <th style=\"padding: 3px 5px; text-align: left; width: 30%;\">Statutory Mandate</th>\n          </tr>\n          <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; background: #ffffff;\">\n            <td style=\"padding: 3px 5px; text-align: center; color: #059669; font-weight: 700;\">[ OK ]</td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 3px 5px;\">Faraday pouch sealed with tamper-evident tape and signed by panchas.</td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 3px 5px;\">Sec 105 BNSS 2023</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; background: #f8fafc;\">\n            <td style=\"padding: 3px 5px; text-align: center; color: #059669; font-weight: 700;\">[ OK ]</td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 3px 5px;\">Pre-extraction and post-extraction SHA-256 hashes match identically.</td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 3px 5px;\">Sec 63 BSA 2023</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; background: #ffffff;\">\n            <td style=\"padding: 3px 5px; text-align: center; color: #059669; font-weight: 700;\">[ OK ]</td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 3px 5px;\">Telecom CDR spreadsheet signed by authorized Nodal Officer.</td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 3px 5px;\">Sec 94 BNSS & Sec 63 BSA</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; background: #f8fafc;\">\n            <td style=\"padding: 3px 5px; text-align: center; color: #059669; font-weight: 700;\">[ OK ]</td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 3px 5px;\">Tower Sector Azimuth and Timing Advance mapped to crime scene radius.</td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 3px 5px;\">Expert Opinion Sec 39 BSA</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr style=\"background: #ffffff;\">\n            <td style=\"padding: 3px 5px; text-align: center; color: #059669; font-weight: 700;\">[ OK ]</td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 3px 5px;\">Video recording of crime scene search & seizure submitted on hash-verified pen drive.</td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 3px 5px;\">Sec 105 BNSS 2023</td>\n          </tr>\n        </table>\n\n        <div style=\"background: rgba(5, 150, 105, 0.08); border-left: 3px solid #059669; padding: 7px 10px; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0; margin-top: 6px;\">\n          <div style=\"font-weight: 700; color: #064e3b; font-size: 0.8rem; margin-bottom: 2px;\">\n            🎓 Congratulations!\n          </div>\n          <p style=\"font-size: 0.76rem; line-height: 1.35; margin: 0;\">\n            You have completed the comprehensive study of <strong>Book 4: Mobile Device Forensics & Telecom CDR Analysis</strong>. Use the interactive <strong>Labs Drawer</strong> to practice realistic terminal commands!\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      "
